            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_N20335">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_1fc8c52d">
                  <p xml:id="idm60">1 bifolio containing No. 1 "Indvielsen"; No. 5 "Lille Cathrine"; and No. 6 "Flyv Fugl, flyv" of "Danske Sange". All stanzas except the first written on as many staves as needed. Above the first stave of No. 1: "<rend xml:id="idm61" rend="underline">Couplets</rend>" and framed: "6 Sange med Piano Forte / I:P:E: Hartmann op: 22." Hartmann later used the Op. No. 22 for "Cantate i Anledning af hendes Majestæt Dronning Caroline Amalias høie Fødselsfest den 28. Juni 1842" (HartW 151).</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
